# LeetCode sync agent

This repo tracks every LeetCode problem in `{number}_{title}/` folders.

## On sync requests or repo maintenance

Run:

```powershell
.\scripts\sync-new-problems.ps1
```

Then summarize results from `config/last-sync.json`.

## Rules

- Never delete or overwrite existing problem folders during sync
- Only create missing folders for newly published LeetCode problems
- Use `.\scripts\new-problem.ps1` for manual one-off scaffolding
- Full agent workflow details are in `AGENTS.md`
